  "post_title": "Jesús Heredia Fuentes, al carrer de Borriana, 21, guanya el concurs de balcons del centre històric d’Onda",
  "post_date": "2018-07-07 06:15:16",
  "post_name": "jesus-heredia-fuentes-al-carrer-de-borriana-21-guanya-el-concurs-de-balcons-del-centre-historic-d%e2%80%99onda",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Medio ambiente|Noticias|Política|Turismo",
  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/07/1erPremiConcursBalconsCentreHistoricOnda4.jpeg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 640px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">(24 fotos) Jes&uacute;s Heredia Fuentes, que viu a la casa del carrer de Borrriana, 21, ha guanyat el concurs de balcons del centre hist&oacute;ric d&#39;Onda, organitzat per l&#39;&agrave;rea de Dinamitzaci&oacute; Econ&ograve;mica de l&#39;Ajuntament.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/07/2onPremiConcursBalconsCentreHistoricOnda-1.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">En el segon premi ha repetit respecte a l&#39;any passat Carmen Gimeno Marim&oacute;n, que t&eacute; la casa al carrer de la Verge de l&#39;Esperan&ccedil;a, 18, al final de les escaletes sense eixida.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/07/3erPremiConcursBalconsCentreHistoricOnda-2.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 640px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">El tercer premi tamb&eacute; coincideix amb el de 2017 per a Utxi Aguilella Falag&aacute;n, del Carrer&oacute; de la Creu, 4, sense eixida i amb entrada des del carrer de Santa Isabel. </span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/07/IMG_6958.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">El mat&iacute; d&#39;aquest divendres l&#39;alcalde, Ximo Huguet Lecha, i el tinent d&#39;alcaldia de Dinamitzaci&oacute; Econ&oacute;mica, &Aacute;ngel Badenas Don&iacute;s, assistits per la t&egrave;cnica de Turisme, Ana Armengol, han donat els diplomes acreditatius al sal&oacute; de plens de l&#39;Ajuntament.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisconcursbalconscentrehistoriconda18/1erpremiconcursbalconscentrehistoriconda1.jpg\" alt=\"1erpremiconcursbalconscentrehistoriconda1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisconcursbalconscentrehistoriconda18/1erpremiconcursbalconscentrehistoriconda2.jpg\" alt=\"1erpremiconcursbalconscentrehistoriconda2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisconcursbalconscentrehistoriconda18/1erpremiconcursbalconscentrehistoriconda3.jpg\" alt=\"1erpremiconcursbalconscentrehistoriconda3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisconcursbalconscentrehistoriconda18/1erpremiconcursbalconscentrehistoriconda4.jpg\" alt=\"1erpremiconcursbalconscentrehistoriconda4\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisconcursbalconscentrehistoriconda18/1erpremiconcursbalconscentrehistoriconda5.jpg\" alt=\"1erpremiconcursbalconscentrehistoriconda5\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisconcursbalconscentrehistoriconda18/2onpremiconcursbalconscentrehistoriconda-1.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisconcursbalconscentrehistoriconda18/2onpremiconcursbalconscentrehistoriconda-2.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/premisconcursbalconscentrehistoriconda18/2onpremiconcursbalconscentrehistoriconda-3.jpg\" alt=\"2onpremiconcursbalconscentrehistoriconda-3\